/// known-gap: interp names the host by the parameter (`target`), so the next tick drops the overlay as an orphan
/// An overlay applied inside an action to a parameter is on the object the
/// parameter holds, and lasts as long as it says.
<>Polity |
    stability: .8
xx
overlay Stunned |
    modifies:
        stability - .25
    end
act stun(target)
    overlay Stunned on target at .5 for 2 ticks
end
rome <> Polity | stability: .8
stun(rome)
say(:overlays_of("rome"))
tick()
say(:overlays_of("rome"))
say(rome >> stability)
tick()
say(:overlays_of("rome"))
say(rome >> stability)
